+   "source": [
+    "**(c) Pruning.** `max_order`, `min_power_dbm` and `max_tones` keep the trace tractable by dropping\n",
+    "products. `trace.pruning` says how many each device lost and the strongest level dropped. `significant`\n",
+    "is `True` when a dropped trace was within 70 dB of the strongest at that node, which is when you should\n",
+    "raise the limits. Here the order cap (9) removes only two products, at -122 dBm, and the IF filter's 90 dB floor sends\n",
+    "most of the rest below the -150 dBm power floor (`dropped_floor`). Nothing significant was lost."
+   ]
